       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTINQ.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY CUSTREC.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC CICS READ FILE('CUSTMAST') INTO(CUST-REC)
                RIDFLD(CUST-ID) END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('DATEUTIL') END-EXEC.
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
